  NodeID: DefeatDragon
  SpeakerName: Narrator
  DialogueText: '"You cast an invisibility spell over yourself and start sneaking
    up on the dragon. Her eyes are searching for you, yet she cannot see you. As
    you get near her belly, you stab her with your dagger, slicing a gash down her
    belly, her intestines start spilling out. She cries out in pain and swipes at
    you, but she misses since she can''t see you."'
